D.104.0100. - The system shall support the ability to send a survey when a logic becomes true.
D.104.0200. - The system shall support the ability to send a survey when another survey is completed.
D.104.0300. - The system shall support the ability to send a survey after a specified time when a logic becomes true and/or when another survey is completed.
D.104.0400. - The system shall support the ability to send reminder surveys when the survey is not completed.
D.104.0500. - The system shall support the ability to download automated survey invitations.
D.104.0600. - The system shall support the ability to upload automated survey invitations.
D.104.0700. - The system shall support the ability to re-evaluate automated survey invitations.
